@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title 範例二：介面 Weighable（沒有共同父類別，也能上同一個秤）

interface Weighable <<interface>> #DFF3E3 {
  + getWeight() : int
}
class Suitcase {
  - emptyWeight : int
  - contentWeight : int
  + Suitcase(emptyWeight : int)
  + pack(kg : int) : void
  + getWeight() : int
}
class Cat {
  - name : String
  - weight : int
  + Cat(name : String, weight : int)
  + meow() : String
  + getWeight() : int
}
class ScaleDemo {
  + {static} main(args : String[]) : void
  ~ {static} weigh(label : String, item : Weighable) : void
}
class NormalParcel #F4F4F4 {
  + getWeight() : int
}
Weighable <|.. Suitcase
Weighable <|.. Cat
ScaleDemo ..> Weighable : weigh 參數
note bottom of NormalParcel
  範例一的包裹也有 getWeight()，
  但沒有 implements Weighable
  → 不能傳給 weigh（編譯錯誤）
end note
@enduml
